{"data":{"body":"**P2 \u2014 Do not convert MDC snapshot failures into terminal workflow failures.** An ordinary failure from `MDC.getCopyOfContextMap()` is routed through `finishFailure`, producing a durable `FAILED` result before any handler or plugin hook runs. Treat snapshot capture as best-effort with an empty baseline, or propagate a retryable invocation-level failure without constructing a terminal execution output.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc772zMW","finding_digest":"0133ad3d67132cc709d324b4bff21ae1d7ecb80233125efebfc5cabeb0237650","finding_id":"arf_v1_aez22plhcmwmocotes2l74q24h","finding_key":"sdk/execution/durableexecutor::supplyhandler::mdc-capture-failure-classification","identity_key":"sdk/execution/durableexecutor::supplyhandler::mdc-capture-failure-classification","line":299,"observation_digest":"9053e48d96792c436605ba068b0398f9c028197714930004c2cf63e5f185a01e","observation_id":"aro_v1_sbj6jdmwpewegzqfxidiwa4y7h","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/execution/DurableExecutor.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_aez22plhcmwmocotes2l74q24h","published_at":"2026-10-09T00:19:27Z","review_id":"arr_v1_uced5uhiw626ix4hlrvxazqc34","reviewed_base_sha":"0c8618e42d3b16e9b7115ab943a93253c0fe936c","reviewed_head_sha":"96356e4841da0c2c7d1ca380207d616d4c74239d","reviewer":"codex","start_line":298,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":769},"record_id":"art_v1_42vc6veet7erza2qlig7rip5jd","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-09T00:19:27Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
